  "generated_text": "1. **Calculate $g(2x)$ and $2g(x)$:**\n   \\[\n   g(2x) = \\sqrt[3]{\\frac{2x+3}{4}}\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   2g(x) = 2 \\cdot \\sqrt[3]{\\frac{x+3}{4}}\n   \\]\n\n2. **Set $g(2x) = 2g(x)$:**\n   \\[\n   \\sqrt[3]{\\frac{2x+3}{4}} = 2 \\cdot \\sqrt[3]{\\frac{x+3}{4}}\n   \\]\n\n3. **Cube both sides to eliminate the cube roots:**\n   \\[\n   \\frac{2x+3}{4} = 8 \\cdot \\frac{x+3}{4}\n   \\]\n\n4. **Simplify and solve for $x$:**\n   \\[\n   2x + 3 = 8x + 24\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   21 = 6x\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   x = \\frac{21}{6}\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{7}\n   \\]",
